WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.370
Confirm teacher and classroom. The teacher must use their own account and assigned classroom. Check the roster before recording an event.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:26.740
Review the roster. Match the selected child with the actual classroom record. Directors resolve incorrect assignments before teachers continue.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:40.110
Check attendance and reports. Attendance, location, photos, daily reports and incidents have separate actions. Check the child and date for each task.

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:53.480
Verify sharing and sync. A saved draft is not proof of parent sharing. Review the result and confirm offline actions have synced before closing the day.

